{title: How Majestic Is Your Name}
{key: G}

{comment: Verse 1}
O [G]Lord, our Lord
How [C]majestic [Am7]is Your [G]name in all the [D7]earth.
O [G]Lord, our Lord
How [C]majestic [Am7] is Your [G]name in all the [D]earth.
O [C]Lord[Am7], we [D]praise [D7]Your [G]name!
O [C]Lord[Am7], we [D]magnify [D7]Your [G]name;
Prince of [Bm]Peace, [A]Might-[A7]y [D]God,
O [G]Lord [C]God [D7sus]Almight [D7] [G]y.
